57.1The Contract Documents
The Contract Documents are enumerated in Article 6 and consist of this Agreement (including, if applicable,
Supplementary and other Conditions of the Contract), Drawings, Specifications, Addenda issued priorto the
execution of this Agreement, other documents listedin this Agreement, and Modifications issued after execution of
